                                       rdfs:label "Service Quality" .


###  https://w3id.org/quay/SingleHost
<https://w3id.org/quay/SingleHost> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/quay/ServiceQuality> ;
