                                           <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Mechanism used to confirm the integrity or authenticity of data after transfer." ;
                                           rdfs:label "Verification Method" .


###  https://w3id.org/quay/Versioned
<https://w3id.org/quay/Versioned> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/quay/TemporalQuality> ;
                                  <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Temporal quality in which data is maintained as a sequence of immutable, individually identifiable revisions." ;
                                  rdfs:label "Versioned" .


###  https://w3id.org/quay/WebDavProtocol
